                <qid><![CDATA[17060]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The AOCS shall provide the on-ground payload data processing with a self-contained dedicated Platform ancillary space packet (NAVATT) containing all required parameters.</p><p>The NAVATT packet shall contain at least the PVT solution in ECEF generated by the active GNSS unit at PPS and its validity.</p>]]></question>
