                <question><![CDATA[<p>If a navigation function is necessary for the mission, the AOCS shall provide the hardware means for autonomous on-board determination of the spacecraft orbital state.</p><p>If a navigation function is necessary for the mission, the AOCS shall provide the software means for autonomous on-board determination of the spacecraft orbital state.</p>]]></question>
