                <id><![CDATA[18240]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17071]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>If a navigation function is necessary for the mission, the system AOCS shall autonomously determine the spacecraft orbital state on-board including position, velocity, and time.</p><p>The system AOCS shall provide hardware and software means to autonomously determine the spacecraft orbital state on-board including position, velocity, and time.</p>]]></question>
