                <id><![CDATA[18243]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17074]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the launcher separation occurs, the AOCS modes shall be able to transition from the initial attitude and rate to the final mission pointing.</p><p>The AOCS modes used for initial acquisition shall provide the capability to achieve final mission pointing from post-separation conditions.</p>]]></question>
