                <id><![CDATA[18244]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17075]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The AOCS-GNC system shall provide the ability to transition from the initial attitude after launcher separation to the final mission pointing.</p><p>The AOCS-GNC system shall provide the ability to transition from the initial rate after launcher separation to the final mission pointing.</p>]]></question>
