            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18319]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17150]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The convention for inertia cross-products shall be one of the following: ∫ I xy = − xy dm, ∫ I xz = − xz dm, ∫ I yz = − yz dm, or ∫ Pxy = + xy dm, ∫ Pxz = + xz dm, ∫ Pyz = + yz dm.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18320]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17151]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The system should use the inertia cross-product convention defined by Ixy = −∫ x·y dm, Ixz = −∫ x·z dm, and Iyz = −∫ y·z dm.</p><p>The system should use the inertia cross-product convention defined by Pxy = +∫ x·y dm, Pxz = +∫ x·z dm, and Pyz = +∫ y·z dm.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18321]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17152]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The convention for inertia cross-products shall be one of the following: ∫ I xy = − xy dm , ∫ I xz = − xz dm , ∫ I yz = − yz dm or ∫ Pxy = + xy dm , ∫ Pxz = + xz dm , ∫ Pyz = + yz pm.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18322]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17153]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The convention for inertia cross-products in the AOCS documentation should be ∫ I xy = − xy dm , ∫ I xz = − xz dm , ∫ I yz = − yz dm or: ∫ Pxy = + xy dm , ∫ Pxz = + xz dm , ∫ Pyz = + yz dm.</p>]]></question>
