                <qid><![CDATA[17156]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the satellite FDIR reports the event FDIR Anomaly, the system AOCS shall detect the event FDIR Anomaly.</p><p>As soon as the satellite FDIR reports the event FDIR Anomaly, the system AOCS shall execute actions on AOCS units required by the satellite FDIR.</p><p>As soon as the satellite FDIR reports the event FDIR Anomaly, the system AOCS shall execute actions on AOCS modes required by the satellite FDIR.</p>]]></question>
