                <qid><![CDATA[17158]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as an anomaly happens, the AOCS shall provide the satellite FDIR with the ability to perform required actions on AOCS units.</p><p>As soon as an anomaly happens, the AOCS shall provide the satellite FDIR with the ability to perform required actions on AOCS modes.</p>]]></question>
