                <qid><![CDATA[17178]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The AOCS shall define an implementation strategy for the mode transitions.</p><p>The AOCS shall describe how the implementation strategy is applied for each AOCS mode transition.</p>]]></question>
