            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18348]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17179]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the ground sends a request, the system shall trigger a transition between modes.</p><p>As soon as the on-board system autonomously checks a transition condition, the system shall trigger a mode transition.</p><p>As soon as a failure is detected, the system shall trigger a mode transition via FDIR.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18349]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17180]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the ground sends a transition request, the system shall trigger a mode transition via TC.</p><p>As soon as the on-board system autonomously checks a transition condition, the system shall trigger a mode transition via AUTO.</p><p>As soon as a failure is detected, the system shall trigger a mode transition via FDIR.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18350]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17181]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the system receives a ground request telecommand without a time tag, the system shall perform the transition between system modes.</p><p>As soon as a failure is detected, the system shall perform the transition between system modes.</p><p>If a defined transition condition is satisfied, the system shall perform the transition between system modes without ground request.</p><p>If the system receives a time-tagged ground request telecommand, the system shall perform the transition between system modes exactly at the specified execution time and not before.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18351]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17182]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>If a ground request (time-tagged or not) is received, the system shall trigger transitions between modes.</p><p>As soon as the system checks a transition condition, the system shall autonomously trigger transitions between modes.</p><p>As soon as the system detects a failure, the system shall trigger transitions between modes.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18352]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17183]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as ground TC requests (time tagged or not), the AOCS shall transition between modes.</p><p>As soon as a autonomous on-bord check of a transition condition is satisfied, the AOCS shall transition between modes.</p><p>As soon as a failure is detected, the AOCS shall provide FDIR with the ability to transition between modes.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18353]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17184]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The system shall provide the operator with the ability to inhibit or force Auto and FDIR transitions by TC.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18354]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17185]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The capability shall be provided to inhibit or to force Auto and FDIR transitions by TC.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18355]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17186]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as a telecommand (TC) requesting inhibition is received, the system shall inhibit Auto transitions and Failure Detection, Isolation, and Recovery (FDIR) transitions.</p><p>As soon as a telecommand (TC) requesting forcing is received, the system shall force Auto transitions and Failure Detection, Isolation, and Recovery (FDIR) transitions.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18356]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17187]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The system shall provide the operator with the ability to inhibit Auto and FDIR transitions via TC.</p><p>The system shall provide the operator with the ability to force Auto and FDIR transitions via TC.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18357]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17188]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The AOCS shall provide ground with the ability to force Auto transitions by TC.</p><p>The AOCS shall provide ground with the ability to inhibit Auto transitions by TC.</p><p>The AOCS shall provide ground with the ability to force FDIR transitions by TC.</p><p>The AOCS shall provide ground with the ability to inhibit FDIR transitions by TC.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
