                <id><![CDATA[18358]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17189]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The AOCS shall process attitude and orbit related information.</p><p>The AOCS shall deliver attitude and orbit related information to other on-board functions.</p>]]></question>
