            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18598]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17429]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the time sheet is in the state IN_PROGRESS and as soon as the last day of a time sheet (either end of week or end of month) occurs, the TSS shall send a reminder mail to the employee.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18599]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17430]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the time sheet reaches the last day (either end of week or end of month) and if the time sheet is in the state IN_PROGRESS, the system TSS shall send a reminder mail to the employee.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18600]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17431]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the time sheet reaches the last day of the week or as soon as the time sheet reaches the last day of the month and if the time sheet is in the state IN_PROGRESS, the system TSS shall send a reminder mail to the employee.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18601]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17432]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the time sheet period ends (either end of week or end of month), and if the time sheet is in state IN_PROGRESS, the TSS shall send a reminder mail to the employee.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18602]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17433]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as a timesheet is on the last day and in state IN_PROGRESS, the TSS shall send a reminder mail to the employee.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18603]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17434]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The TSS shall provide assistants and supervisors with the ability to request changes to a time sheet in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE.</p><p>As soon as a change is requested to a time sheet in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE, the time sheet shall change to IN_PROGRESS status.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18604]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17435]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>If assistants request changes to a time sheet in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE, the TSS shall change the time sheet to IN_PROGRESS status.</p><p>If supervisors request changes to a time sheet in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE, the TSS shall change the time sheet to IN_PROGRESS status.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18605]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17436]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as a time sheet is in the state SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE and as soon as the system TSS receives a change-request submission from an assistant or a supervisor for the time sheet, the system TSS shall accept the change-request submission and set the state of the time sheet to IN_PROGRESS.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18606]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17437]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as assistants and supervisors request changes to a time sheet in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE, the TSS shall change the time sheet status to IN_PROGRESS.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18607]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17438]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the timesheet is in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE, the TSS shall provide assistants with the ability to request changes to the timesheet.</p><p>As long as the timesheet is in status SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE, the TSS shall provide supervisors with the ability to request changes to the timesheet.</p><p>As soon as changes are requested to a timesheet, the TSS shall change the timesheet status to IN_PROGRESS.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18608]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17439]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The TSS should provide the employee with the ability to revoke the signature.</p><p>As soon as the employee revokes the signature, the time sheet shall change from SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE to IN_PROGRESS status.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18609]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17440]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The TSS shall provide the employee with the ability to revoke the signature.</p><p>As soon as the employee revokes the signature, the timesheet shall change from SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE to IN_PROGRESS status.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18610]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17441]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the system TSS receives a signature revocation request for a time sheet from an employee, the system TSS shall set the status of the time sheet to IN_PROGRESS after revoking the signature of the time sheet.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18611]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17442]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As soon as the employee revokes the signature, the system shall change the time sheet status from SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE to IN_PROGRESS.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[18612]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17443]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The TSS should provide employees with the ability to revoke the signature.</p><p>As soon as the employee revokes the signature, the TSS shall change the timesheet status from SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE to IN_PROGRESS.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
