                <question><![CDATA[<p>The TSS shall provide the employee with the ability to sign a time sheet.</p><p>As soon as the employee signs the time sheet, the status of the time sheet shall change from IN_PROGRESS to SIGNED_BY_EMPLOYEE.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
