                <id><![CDATA[18807]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17638]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The TSS shall provide assistants with the ability to start the contract</p><p>The TSS shall provide supervisors with the ability to start the contract.</p><p>As soon as the contract is started, the TSS shall change the contract status from PREPARED to STARTED.</p><p>As soon as the contract is started, the TSS shall create all Timesheets in status IN_PROGRESS.</p>]]></question>
