                <qid><![CDATA[17642]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>If the time sheet is in IN_PROGRESS status and the contract is in STARTED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to add, change, or remove time sheet entries.</p>]]></question>
