                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the timesheet is in IN_PROGRESS status and the contract of the timesheet is in STARTED status, the TSS shall allow to add timesheet entries.</p><p>As long as the timesheet is in IN_PROGRESS status and the contract of the timesheet is in STARTED status, the TSS shall allow to change timesheet entries.</p><p>As long as the timesheet is in IN_PROGRESS status and the contract of the timesheet is in STARTED status, the TSS shall allow to remove timesheet entries.</p>]]></question>
