                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the start date.</p><p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the end date.</p><p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the frequency.</p><p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the hours per week.</p><p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the vacation hours.</p><p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the working days per week.</p><p>As long as the contract is in PREPARED status, the TSS shall provide the user with the ability to change the vacation days per year.</p>]]></question>
