                <question><![CDATA[<p>The EVS shall provide the organizer with the ability to access polls related to them.</p><p>The EVS shall provide the administrator with the ability to access polls.</p><p>The information displayed to the administrator shall be limited to the poll title, voting period, and the organizers.</p>]]></question>
