                <question><![CDATA[<p>The EVS shall provide the administrators with the ability to view the poll title.</p><p>The EVS shall provide the administrators with the ability to view the voting period.</p><p>The EVS shall provide the administrators with the ability to view the organizers of the polls.</p><p>The EVS shall provide the organizers with the ability to access the polls.</p>]]></question>
