            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[19060]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17891]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The system shall provide the organizer with the ability to add a single choice question to a poll.</p><p>The system shall restrict single choice questions to have at least two items.</p><p>The system shall enforce that single choice questions permit selecting exactly one item.</p><p>The system shall provide the organizer with the ability to add a multiple choice question to a poll.</p><p>The system shall enforce that multiple choice questions have at least two items.</p><p>The system shall provide the organizer with the ability to add a yes/no question to a poll.</p><p>The system shall restrict the answer options of a yes/no question to the items Yes and No.</p><p>The system shall enforce single selection for yes/no questions.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[19061]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17892]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The system shall provide organizers with the ability to add SINGLE CHOICE questions containing two or more items and allowing exactly one choice.</p><p>The system shall provide organizers with the ability to add MULTIPLE CHOICE questions containing two or more items and allowing multiple choices.</p><p>The system shall provide organizers with the ability to add YES/NO questions with exactly two items ("yes" and "no") and allowing exactly one choice.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[19062]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[17893]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>The EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to add SINGLE CHOICE questions with two or more items and one choice to their polls.</p><p>The EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to add MULTIPLE CHOICE questions with two or more items to their polls.</p><p>The EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to add YES/NO questions with two items “yes” and “no” and one choice to their polls.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
