                <question><![CDATA[<p>The EVS shall provide the participant with the ability to cancel a voting by closing the browser.</p><p>The EVS shall provide the participant with the ability to cancel a voting by clicking a cancel button.</p><p>The token from a cancelled voting shall be re-usable later.</p>]]></question>
