            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[19358]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[18189]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the poll is in the state PREPARED, the EVS shall allow changes to the description of the poll.</p><p>As long as the poll is in the state PREPARED, the EVS shall allow changes to the initial voting period of the poll.</p><p>As long as the poll is in the state PREPARED, the EVS shall allow changes to the questions of the poll.</p><p>As long as the poll is in the state PREPARED, the EVS shall allow changes to the participant list of the poll.</p>]]></question>
