            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[19360]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[18191]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as a poll is in the state PREPARED, the system EVS shall allow updating the description of the poll only.</p><p>As long as a poll is in the state PREPARED, the system EVS shall allow updating the initial voting period of the poll only.</p><p>As long as a poll is in the state PREPARED, the system EVS shall allow updating the questions of the poll only.</p><p>The system EVS shall allow modifying the participant list of the poll only when the poll is in the state PREPARED.</p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
