                <id><![CDATA[19361]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[18192]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the poll is in state PREPARED, the EVS shall allow changes to the description, initial voting period, questions, and participant list of the poll.</p>]]></question>
