                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
            </row>
            <row>
                <id><![CDATA[19362]]></id>
                <qid><![CDATA[18193]]></qid>
                <question><![CDATA[<p>As long as the poll is in state PREPARED, the EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to change the description.</p><p>As long as the poll is in state PREPARED, the EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to change the initial voting period.</p><p>As long as the poll is in state PREPARED, the EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to change questions. </p><p>As long as the poll is in state PREPARED, the EVS shall provide organizers with the ability to change the participant list. </p><p>As long as the poll is not in state PREPARED, the EVS shall prevent changes of the description.</p><p>As long as the poll is not in state PREPARED, the EVS shall prevent changes of the initial voting period.</p><p>As long as the poll is not in state PREPARED, the EVS shall prevent changes of questions. </p><p>As long as the poll is not in state PREPARED, the EVS shall prevent changes of the participant list. </p>]]></question>
                <help />
                <script />
                <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
